          "path": "_m/g/c/r/j/nottingham-playhouse-wp/nottingham-playhouse-1967-geog.jpg",
          "filename": "Nottingham Playhouse, 1967 - geograph.org.uk - 1537550.jpg",
          "caption": "Nottingham Playhouse, 1967. The Playhouse was designed by Peter Moro and opened in 1963. Previously the company had used a former cinema (still there 790013 ) on the corner of Goldsmith Street. If, like me, you were an A-level English student in the mid sixties, the Playhouse was the place to be: for three-and-six (17.5p), student members could see John Neville as Richard II, Judi Dench as St Joan and playing opposite Edward Woodward in \"Private Lives\", and a whole host of other wonderful things - one heck of an education, subsidised by an enlightened city council. This photo is taken across Wellington Circus and also shows what might have been Nottingham's first pavement cafe. A VW Beetle, a Ford Cortina and a Mini complete a real sixties scene. Compare this photograph with my 2009 picture 1592180.",
          "alt": "Nottingham Playhouse, 1967. The Playhouse was designed by Peter Moro and opened in 1963. Previously the company had used a former cinema (still there 790013 ) on the corner of Goldsmith Street. If, like me, you were an A-level English student in the mid sixties, the Playhouse was the place to be: for three-and-six (17.5p), student members could see John Neville as Richard II, Judi Dench as St Joan and playing opposite Edward Woodward in \"Private Lives\", and a whole host of other wonderful things - one heck of an education, subsidised by an enlightened city council. This photo is taken across Wellington Circus and also shows what might have been Nottingham's first pavement cafe. A VW Beetle, a Ford Cortina and a Mini complete a real sixties scene. Compare this photograph with my 2009 picture 1592180.",
          "width": 640,
          "height": 488,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
          "artist": "John Sutton",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nottingham_Playhouse,_1967_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1537550.jpg",
